  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Description: Light up your accessories with our Glow Sand AirPods Cases! These unique cases not only protect your AirPods but also double as a fun fidget toy. Each case is filled with flowing sand that you can play with, creating a soothing effect while keeping your hands busy. And when the lights go out—they glow in the dark, making your AirPods easy to spot and adding a cool, luminous vibe. Available in vibrant colors like Neon Red, Aqua Blue, Lime Green, Hot Pink, and Classic White, these cases bring protection, playfulness, and style all in one.",
  "description_html": "<p>Description:<br>Light up your accessories with our Glow Sand AirPods Cases! These unique cases not only protect your AirPods but also double as a fun fidget toy. Each case is filled with flowing sand that you can play with, creating a soothing effect while keeping your hands busy. And when the lights go out—they glow in the dark, making your AirPods easy to spot and adding a cool, luminous vibe. Available in vibrant colors like Neon Red, Aqua Blue, Lime Green, Hot Pink, and Classic White, these cases bring protection, playfulness, and style all in one.</p>"
